"The guide suggests starting at the Yanille elder tree, then cutting at Varrock, then teleporting to Edgeville to cut and bank. Repeat that rotation.",
"Another source route uses Varrock and the elder trees north and south of Draynor Village, banking at Draynor. Tree depletion and regrowth times determine when you move.",
"Rotate between elder trees in Yanille, Varrock and Edgeville, or Varrock and the two Draynor-area trees.",
