"adding-herbs-to-incense-sticks.kwuarm",
"Amounts are the Wiki guide's hourly figures at 100% pace. Set your own pace as a percentage of the guide's.",
"guide_pace",
"% of guide pace",
"Making incense sticks is a profitable way to gain Firemaking experience, although slower than usual training methods. Kwuarm incense sticks is useful in PvM when using weapon poison.",
"27 incense sticks can be made per inventory, and each inventory takes 48.6 seconds. A bank preset of a stack of Accursed acadia incense sticks and 27 Clean kwuarm is recommended to achieve a maximum of close to 972 sticks made per hour.",
"However, there is not much trading volume and profit margin for whoever makes those, therefore you may find it hard to buy Accursed acadia incense sticks on the Grand Exchange.",
"High",
"Use a convenient bank to withdraw the listed supplies and deposit the results.",
"Bank",
"FIREMAKING",
"54 Firemaking",
"Ring of fire and Flame gloves recommended for Fired Up set, for bonus XP",
"Pyro-matic or Augmented crystal tinderbox recommended for Invention Item experience",
"Quick-cense upgrade from Garden of Kharid is highly recommended, otherwise profit per hour is halved",
"wiki",
"Money making guide/Adding herbs to incense sticks",
"https://runescape.wiki/w/Money_making_guide/Adding_herbs_to_incense_sticks?oldid=36473760",
"Adding herbs to incense sticks",
"Kwuarm",
"adding-herbs-to-incense-sticks.lantadyme",
"Making incense sticks is a profitable way to gain Firemaking experience, although slower than usual training methods. Lantadyme incense sticks is useful in PvM to reduce the cost of using potions when using multiple high level potions at once.",
"27 incense sticks can be made per inventory, and each inventory takes 48.6 seconds. A bank preset of a stack of Infernal yew incense sticks and 27 Clean lantadyme is recommended to achieve a maximum of close to 972 sticks made per hour.",
"However, there is not much trading volume and profit margin for whoever makes those, therefore you may find it hard to buy Infernal yew incense sticks on the Grand Exchange.",
"67 Firemaking",
"Lantadyme",
"adding-herbs-to-incense-sticks.spirit-weed",
"Making incense sticks is a profitable way to gain Firemaking experience, although slower than usual training methods. Spirit weed incense sticks is useful in PvM when using familiar special attacks often.",
"27 incense sticks can be made per inventory, and each inventory takes 48.6 seconds. A bank preset of a stack of Impious willow incense sticks and 27 Clean spirit weed is recommended to achieve a maximum of close to 972 sticks made per hour.",
"However, there is not much trading volume and profit margin for whoever makes those, therefore you may find it hard to buy Impious willow incense sticks on the Grand Exchange.",
"35 Firemaking",
"Spirit weed",
"adding-herbs-to-incense-sticks.torstol",
"Making incense sticks is a profitable way to gain Firemaking experience, although slower than usual training methods. Torstol incense sticks increase XP gained and are often used to train expensive skills.",
"27 incense sticks can be made per inventory, and each inventory takes 48.6 seconds. A bank preset of a stack of Infernal magic incense sticks and 27 Clean torstol is recommended to achieve a maximum of close to 972 sticks made per hour.",
"However, there is not much trading volume and profit margin for whoever makes those, therefore you may find it hard to buy Infernal magic incense sticks on the Grand Exchange.",
"75 Firemaking",
"Torstol",
"big-game-hunter.tier-1-dinosaurs",
"Fixed value set by the Wiki guide.",
"It also assumes both a fully upgraded hunter lodge and bait boxes. Without these, profit rates will decrease due to slower catch rates + banking.",
"Due to variance in monster spawns, (1/16 chance for double encounters and 1/160 for triple), as well as anywhere from 5-7 instances occurring before sending a creature into hiding, this method may vary. Experienced players will likely be able to clear 3 monsters within slightly less than an hour.",
"When starting an instance, withdraw 6 of the necessary bait. Inventory should always be prioritised to handle a double encounter (8 logs, 6 vines), as these encounters increase gp/hr rates, but will prove much more difficult without anticipation. Likewise, it is highly recommended that in the beginning of an instance, you first make 18 spears. Then, if the hunter lodge is.",
"Fully upgraded: randomly pick one of the available frog types and make 3 poison spears of the same colour and proceed to gather logs and vines to make the traps. This will provide a 50/50 chance of killing the creature on the first try. If the wrong colour was chosen, fix the traps that broke, and tip a few more spears--enough to deplete the creature's hp to zero.",
"For a first visit, board The Stormbreaker on the river east of the Varrock Dig Site and complete the arrival tutorial.",
"Use After the tutorial, build and activate the Anachronia lodestone at Base Camp for future visits.",
"Anachronia",
