"buying-crossbows-from-shops.standard",
"Can be done every 24 hours; a run takes about 6 minutes.",
"Crossbows are sometimes used for low level ranging training, but more commonly they are disassembled for components. You can buy more items from each of the shops but due to the small profit margins I have ignored them. It's also worth noting that with less items in your inventory the faster you can complete this moneymaker. The Crossbow Shop (Dwarven Mine) and Crossbow Shop (White Wolf Mountain) share the same stock, with White Wolf Mountain being slightly easier to get to.",
"A beast of burden will be useful if you have the summoning level for it. Start off by banking all items except, magic notepaper and equip a ring of wealth to travel to Keldagrim.",
"Teleport to Taverley lodestone and run north to the cave next to the POH portal.",
"Run west and talk to Holoy at the Crossbow Shop (White Wolf Mountain).",
"Buy all of the crossbows and note them.",
