"buying-plant-cures.standard",
"Buy plant cure from Head Farmer Jones's Farming Shop in Taverley for 40 coins each. After buying a full inventory deposit them at the bank to the south or use the War's Retreat Teleport for quick bank access. Then use the explorer's ring 3 to teleport to Sarah's Farming Shop near Falador and buy more plant cure. Home teleport, bank and buy another lot of plant cures at Vanessa's Farming Shop in Catherby. There are 10 in stock in each shop but it only takes about ~60 seconds for them to fully restock. Each trip takes about 2 minutes to get 28 potions. We can make approximately 30 trips per hour, so that gives us 840 potions per hour.",
