"cleaning-grimy-toadflax.standard",
"Toadflax is in high demand because of its use in Saradomin brews. It is often profitable to clean the grimy herbs and sell them on the Grand Exchange. Like all methods involving large amounts of buying and selling, it is recommended to test the market first to make sure cleaning toadflax is profitable.",
"Please note that Grimy toadflax has a buying limit of 10,000 every four hours, so you may clean them faster than you can buy them.",
