"collecting-dinosaur-eggs-from-seggregation.standard",
"Dinosaur eggs can be collected quickly from the Seggregation activity by collecting eggs from the pile of dinosaur eggs and destroying the good and bad eggs. This allows the dinosaur eggs which are occasionally found during this activity to be obtained rapidly as there is no need to move between stations in order to produce sharp shell shards.",
