"Assumes the guide's 5 kills per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"Sanctum of Rebirth (Hard Mode). Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"Your actual profit may be higher or lower depending on your kill speed and efficiency.",
"Refer to the Sanctum of Rebirth strategy guide for information on the fight. If desired, a blood reaver or hellhound familiar to replace the ripper demon may also suffice. The runes factored in include five uses of darkness, assuming complete runs of the Sanctum of Rebirth being less than 12 minutes, along with various uses of Invoke Death for the bosses, alongside both forms of Nephtys and both of Kezalam's obelisks, and Split Soul being used once at Vermyx and twice at Kezalam and Nakatra. Life Transfer is also expected to be used at least twice per boss. At the minimum, five uses of Conjure Undead Army are expected throughout the full run, once at Vermyx and twice at Kezalam and Nakatra respectively, contributing to the addition of Ectoplasm. The quantity given may not be exact to one's full run, depending on extraneous options such as using Threads of Fate or Lesser Bone Shield, though the quantity is similar.",
"Accessing the Sanctum of Rebirth requires the completion of Soul Searching.",
"Use the combat portal in the Max Guild (requires level 99 in every skill).",
