"Complete the Zarosian IV collection. Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"Completing the Zarosian IV collection has an extremely high output of chronotes. This assumes that you complete a collection in an hour (could take more or less time depending on stats/gear). Profit assumes buying the remaining materials, estimated at half of the total cost of materials (more than half for some of the more rare materials to obtain while collecting artefacts, and less than half for some of the more common). Profit will be higher or lower depending on level/gear/materials obtained per artefact. Chances of staff pieces are based on 140 materials obtained per hour while excavating artefacts.",
