"crafting-carapace-boots.standard",
"The player should make a preset of 27 threads and 27 carapace. It should take you 52 seconds to craft 27 carapace boots (with banking). You should be able to craft 1.869 carapace boots an hour. All of the 1,869 threads won't be needed because 1 thread may be used to craft multiple items. It should be noted that carapace may be hard to buy at the Grand Exchange. It's recommended to do this 1 hour at a time since the carapace boots may be hard to sell but they should be able to sell slow overtime. The player may do other money making methods in the meantime while waiting for the item to buy/sell. It's possible to craft other carapace items if carapace boots are currently selling slow.",
