"crafting-death-runes-with-tirannwn-quiver-3.standard",
"The Tirannwn quiver 3 gives 5 free teleports to the Death altar each day. Start at a bank and fill your essence pouches, as well as ethereal body and familiar if you have them. Activate your Tirannwn quiver 3 and use keybind 5 to teleport to the death altar, enter and craft your runes. Teleport back to a bank and repeat another 4 times. This method can be combined with the use of the free teleports from the Wicked hood to get extended use out of your summoning familiar, however, it is generally more profitable to craft other runes with those teleports, see Wicked hood.",
