"crafting-law-runes-through-the-abyss.standard",
"Assumes the guide's 94 actions per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"Using the expansive pouch, the full infinity ethereal outfit, and reserving one space for a powerburst of sorcery, you can hold up to 128 essence per trip. If you do not have the expansive pouch, then be sure to regularly repair the pouches as the giant pouch degrades after 12 uses or use the Pouch Protector relic power.",
"With optimised dives and surges, one can expect around 120–150 trips an hour, while without using any mobility abilities, one can expect 94–112 trips an hour.",
"The Mage of Zamorak is located low-level wilderness, near the source of the River Lum. See Abyss for more information on how to navigate the abyss. Alternatively, the Nexus Mod relic power allows you to enter the Abyss directly at the centre.",
"Break a law altar teleport tablet. It teleports the player to the ruins.",
"Teleport to Port Sarim using the Port Sarim lodestone, Captain's Log, or Arc journal, then board the ship to Entrana.",
"Law altar",
