"crafting-royal-dragonhide-bodies.standard",
"The rates assume 1800 bodies are made per hour with Portable crafters, Scroll of dexterity, Brooch of the Gods, Modified artisan's bandana and a Beast of Burden such as a Pack Yak along with bank presets to minimize banking time. This method is viable without any of these, but rates are lower. Each items effect to profits are marked at the end of the guide.",
"The player should make a preset of 18 threads and fill rest of the inventory and possible Beast of burden with Royal dragon leathers. It should take you 36 seconds to craft 18 royal dragonhide bodies (with banking). You should be able to craft 1800 royal dragonhide bodies an hour. All of the 1800 threads won't be needed because 1 thread may be used to craft multiple royal dragonhide bodies. With Crafting cape no threads are needed.",
"To find the current location of a Portable crafter, ask in the \"portables\" Friends chat.",
"Lacking recommended and optional items affect profits as follows.",
