"crafting-soul-runes.without-catalytic-anima-stones",
"The numbers listed assumes using expansive pouch, the Infinity ethereal outfit, the Abyssal Titan, and running 5.4 trips per hour while using the Powerburst of sorcery every time you go through the abyss. It also assumes that the player has Wilderness elite tasks complete for Magical thread as well as using urns with the urn enhancer.",
"crafting-time-runes-through-the-abyss.standard",
"The numbers listed assumes using expansive pouch, the Infinity ethereal outfit, and the Abyssal Titan, and running 90 trips per hour while using the powerburst of sorcery every fourth trip. The quantity of anima stones consumed per hour does not account for the Runecrafting cape perk activating (the cape acts as free anima stones, taking priority over the anima stones in the inventory).",
"With optimised dives and surges, one can expect around 92–109 trips an hour, while without using any mobility abilities, one can expect 73–83 trips an hour. Unlike most other methods of runecrafting using the abyss, it is better to not use the Nexus Mod relic here as it places you so far from the portal to the time altar. Going through the outer ring instead saves approximately 2 seconds per trip.",
"The Mage of Zamorak is located in low-level wilderness, near the source of the River Lum. This may be accessed without PvP enabled so will be generally safe aside from monsters in the abyss.",
"Load last preset from bank (manually load it the first time).",
"As with most other rune temples, it can be accessed via the Abyss. The time rift requires the ruins to be anchored using the enchanted key from Making History or the enchanted key from Meeting History at the time altar.",
"The fastest way to get there is through the Abyss with the Nexus Mod relic power and teleporting to Edgeville using the Wilderness sword.",
"A second way to get there is to use the North-western Anachronia Teleport spell or tablet. Harnessing the Abyssal Link relic power causes the spell to no longer require runes.",
"A third way to get there is to cast Anachronia Teleport if the Totem of the Abyss is placed on the totem pedestal on the north side of Anachronia.",
