"Can be done every 4 hours; a run takes about 13 minutes.",
"Spirit mementos are needed for greater communion rituals in Necromancy. The main limiting factor of this money making method is the buy limit of 1,000 fragile mementos every 4 hours.",
"The player should make a bank preset of 90 vibrant energy and 27 fragile mementos. A full inventory can be converted in approximately 20 seconds.",
