"excavating-material-cache-blood-of-orcus.standard",
"Assumes the guide's 400 actions per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"Travel to and excavate the material cache (Blood of Orcus) located on the floor 2 above ground of the Slayer Tower in Canifis. The Canifis lodestone is located nearby. There are 3 material caches that you can excavate from: you can also hop worlds if you deplete all the caches before they respawn.",
"Profits will be affected by the level of mattock used. To increase profit further players can use a mattock with perks such as Honed and Fortune. Using perks such as Imp Souled or Refined may reduce the usage of porter charges and the need to world hop. If owned the master archaeologist's outfit grants a 7% increased excavation rate; a ring of Whispers can invisibly boost Archaeology by 3 levels to increase excavation rate and the waterfiend familiar has the effect of doubling resources 5% of the time when gathering.",
"Kharid-Et Dig Site- Chapel Excavation Site",
"58 Archaeology",
"Rune mattock or better",
"Grace of the elves recommended to store porter charges if owned",
"Money making guide/Excavating material cache (Blood of Orcus)",
"https://runescape.wiki/w/Money_making_guide/Excavating_material_cache_(Blood_of_Orcus)?oldid=36771651",
"Excavating material cache (Blood of Orcus)",
"excavating-material-cache-stormguard-steel.standard",
"Excavation rates are based on near minimum level and non-augmented dragon mattock. Upgrades may significantly increase profit.",
"Stormguard steel can be excavated from material cache (Stormguard steel). There is a materials cart close by in the Stormguard Citadel Dig Site. Assuming you have unlocked 250 capacity for the archaeological soil box, it takes about 100 minutes for a full trip. World hopping is necessary as the caches deplete faster than they respawn (2 minutes).",
"Use Archaeology journal, teleport to the Archaeology Campus then running west, inside the main building, and use the dig sites map table inside to teleport to it directly.",
"Use Master archaeologist's outfit teleport function.",
"Use Ardougne lodestone then running north-east.",
"Stormguard Citadel Dig Site",
