"gathering-golden-roses-with-rapid-growth.standard",
"Rapid Growth can be used once (twice with the full master farmer outfit) every day on all four flower patches in Het's Oasis, making them instantly harvestable. When you harvest flowers at Het's Oasis, you get a chance to harvest golden roses. Using compost on the plant before cultivating it increases this chance, with better compost giving a higher chance. These roses can be used to catch dazzling whirligigs, whose shells can be ground into powder of penance.",
