"harvesting-vibrant-energy.standard",
"Vibrant energy is in demand for creating Sign of the porter IV. It is also useful for those who want the extra Divination experience from converting memories with energy and for creating Divine box traps. 60 Divination is required to harvest vibrant energy, but having level 75 gives the best chances of harvesting enriched vibrant memories and gives 3 energy per harvest. Remember that in order for an enriched wisp to spawn, players must empower the rift with the chronicle fragments that they collect, which grant their normal experience reward while doing so. Harvest it for a guaranteed supply of enriched memories. Enriched memories can be converted to twice the energy that normal memories can.",
"With level 98 Archaeology and 86 Invention, the player can unlock the Divine Conversion relic, which allows the conversion of a whole inventory of memories in one go.",
"Use the South Feldip Hills Teleport.",
"Teleport with a ring of duelling to the Warforge Dig Site.",
