"havenhythe-big-game-hunter.chinchompas",
"Assumes the guide's 25 actions per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"Giant chinchompas take slightly longer to kill, however the meat obtained is more valuable potentially offering larger profits. The quantities of apex hide and raw giant chinchompa meat stated here assume that giant golden chinchompas are hunted.",
"Start the encounter by consuming one Azurite moth jar to assist with finding the optimal moth or poison to hunt the creatures. Once this is found it will not change for the hour meaning that only the Calcite and Sugilite moths need to be up-kept beyond this.",
"Getting to Havenhythe for the first time requires starting and progressing through the quest Visions of Havenhythe, started at the Rusty Anchor Tavern in Port Sarim. If left prior to completing the quest, Captain Lorris is the only method to return to Havenhythe.",
"Use Wendlewick lodestone located in Wendlewick.",
"At level 28 Magic, Wendlewick Teleport can be cast on the standard spellbook, teleporting to the centre of the town.",
"Fairy ring BKS takes you to the Shrine of Inanna, south of Wendlewick.",
"Havenhythe",
"77 Slayer",
