"Kill Araxxi. Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"Your actual profit may be higher or lower depending on your speed and Araxxor's enrage. Note that with more experience and max guild teleport, it is possible to get 10-13 kills an hour and upwards of 20 kills an hour when path 1/2 is open and you are duoing. However, the drop rate of leg pieces are reduced when killing the pair with a partner.",
"You have to finish all four stages before leaving in order to get the loot and leave the fight. It is highly recommended that you bring Araxyte pheromone in your inventory or use an instance, since this will cause Araxxor to spawn in the combat style weakest to yours for the first 3 stages of the fight.",
