"Kill automaton guardians. Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"The automatons can be accessed after completing The World Wakes and the other required quests. The easiest way to get to them is to use the Sixth-Age circuit to teleport to Guthix's Cave, and then teleporting into the main chamber by talking to the Guthixian High Druid. The guardians are located in the central part of the chamber.",
