"Kill cave horrors. Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"Your actual profit may be higher or lower depending on your speed and actual drop rates.",
"In addition, the vast majority of their drops are noted or otherwise stackable, allowing for long trips. They are located in the Mos Le'Harmless Caves, access to which requires completion of Cabin Fever. Players also need a light source and a witchwood icon to avoid taking a great deal of damage. The easiest ways to get to the caves are taking the fairy ring DIP (requires A Fairy Tale III - Battle at Ork's Rift), or taking Bill Teach's boat from Port Phasmatys to Mos Le'Harmless, then travelling east from the town.",
"Teleport using rum (red) or rum (blue) bought from Honest Jimmy's House of Stuff.",
"Accessing through the fairy ring DIP.",
"If using the fairy ring shortcut, the player must first complete A Fairy Tale III - Battle at Ork's Rift and repair the bridges connecting the fairy ring island to the Mos le'Harmless mainland. This will require a total of 8 regular planks and 16 nails of any kind. Each bridge must be repaired from a different side, meaning the player must fix it from the Mos Le'Harmless side as well as the fairy ring island side if it is the first time using the shortcut.",
"Teleport to Mos Le'Harmless using the Big Book o' Piracy, then use the stepping stone to the east to cross the river.",
