"Chickens can be killed at Fred the Farmer's farm, just north of the Lumbridge Market and its bank chest. It's important to use area loot for this method. Chickens drop raw chicken, feathers, and bones. The bones should be bound to your action bar to quickly bury it for prayer experience. The other items should be banked and then sold.",
