"killing-grifolapines.standard",
"Kill grifolapines. Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"The grifolapines in the Polypore Dungeon have good drops, but they are not very challenging to kill and can be done without banking. Grifolapines are located on the third level of the dungeon, consult for more information. Pick a location with three or more grifolapines. These monsters are scattered throughout the third level of the dungeon, and it does not matter how close or far it is from the entrance; all drops are either noted or stackable items.",
"Mask of the Ganodermic or Helm of the Ganodermic (recommended)",
