"killing-vyrelords-and-vyreladies.standard",
"Kill vyrelords and vyreladies. Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"A good spot to AFK for suitably geared players is between the tree and west of the building, which is south of the bank.",
"Alching all the dragon spears and splitbark drops will help keep you from banking. The splitbark helms can be used to drop on the ground, and using area loot, can pick up drops. Making use of a legendary pet to pick up drops is also convenient.",
"Darkmeyer is hard to reach and one is required to wear the full Darkmeyer disguise to not be caught and thrown out, or the House Drakan outfit, acquired part way through The Lord of Vampyrium.",
"Climb into a hole in the very north-east of Meiyerditch.",
