"making-botanist-s-amulets.string-jewellery",
"Upon completion of all of the unstrung amulets, proceed to string all of them using String Jewellery. Wield a mud battlestaff to save the water and earth rune cost. the The stringing should not take nearly as long as either of the two other processes.",
"String Jewellery",
"making-extra-fine-sand-with-telekinetic-grind.standard",
"Assumes the guide's 2,000 actions per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"The experience and profit assumes the usage of the listed optional items. If one or more of these items aren't used, the profit and experience may be lower than expected.",
"As the amount of sandstone ground in an hour exceeds the buy limit of 10,000 an hour, sandstone needs to be either bought from other players, or bought ahead of time, before using this money making method. Grinding one specific type of sandstone might earn the player more gp/hr than grinding all types of sandstone equally. Though, due to the buy limit of 10,000, all sandstone types are listed to allow this method to work more consistently.",
"It is theoretically possible to process up to 6,000 inventories per hour, though this would require robot-like click precision and no mistakes or lag.",
"The following setup involves the least amount of clicking for processing large amounts of Extra Fine Sand in 3 ticks.",
"Stand at a one-click bank (such as the one in War's retreat).",
"85 Magic",
"Small rune pouch or Large rune pouch to grind 28 sandstone at once",
"Artisan's outfit for 6% extra crafting exp",
"Law staff recommended to save 10% law runes",
"Money making guide/Making extra fine sand with Telekinetic Grind",
"https://runescape.wiki/w/Money_making_guide/Making_extra_fine_sand_with_Telekinetic_Grind?oldid=36804175",
"Making extra fine sand with Telekinetic Grind",
"making-ghostly-ink.greater",
"To create ghostly ink, the player should create a preset with 260 of the corresponding necroplasm, 13 vials of water, and 13 ashes. Then load the preset, either click the necroplasm in inventory or add it to an action bar and press the key for it to open the crafting interface, craft the ink, and repeat. It takes 1.2 seconds (2 ticks) to craft ink, so a full inventory takes 15.6 seconds. If the player spends 2.4 seconds (4 ticks) per inventory banking, this allows up to 2,600 ink to be made per hour, although Necroplasm has a buy limit of 50,000 every four hours.",
"Necromancy!",
"Money making guide/Making ghostly ink",
"https://runescape.wiki/w/Money_making_guide/Making_ghostly_ink?oldid=36684752",
