"making-infernal-urns.standard",
"The result may differ from player to player.",
"The urns can be made by going to the Crafting guild and making them at the Potter's wheel. After that, go to the Potter's oven and turn them into Infernal urn (no rune). They can then be deposited in the nearby bank deposit box (or bank chest if hard Falador achievements have been completed). You can combine mining clay and making soft clay to earn more profit.",
"Portable crafters are recommended for their 10% chance of saving clay and 10% chance of saving unfired urns.",
"A skills necklace or modified artisan's bandana can be used to teleport to the Crafting Guild.",
"Teleport to the Port Sarim lodestone and running north-west.",
"Teleport to the Rimmington player-owned house portal.",
"Members who have unlocked the Crafting Guild hot air balloon route after completing Enlightened Journey can take a hot air balloon to just north of the Crafting Guild for a fee of two charges.",
"The urns can be made by going to the Crafting guild and making them at the Potter's wheel. After that, go to the Potter's oven and turn them into Infernal urn (no rune). They can then be deposited in the nearby bank deposit box (or bank chest if hard Falador achievements have been completed).",
