"making-primal-extracts.102-herblore",
"The theoretical maximum number of crafts per hour is 3000, however it is very unlikely that a player will reach this due to various factors such as lag and imperfect timing/inputs. With this level you will only be able to make 26 extracts per inventory (13 crafts) as you will need 1 slot for the pulp causing an odd number of remaining slots for vials. The herblore requirement for this level is not boostable.",
"Primal extract is highly sought after for its use in making many high-level potions including weapon poison+++ and various powerburst potions. For less hourly profit but a higher ROI, players can purchase primal fruits and crush them into the primal fruit pulp themselves. This, however, requires 90 Cooking to do. The recommended fruits to crush are golden dragonfruit for fastest rates and guarana for highest profit.",
"102 Herblore",
