"making-primal-extracts.112-herblore",
"The theoretical maximum number of crafts per hour is 3000, however it is very unlikely that a player will reach this due to various factors such as lag and imperfect timing/inputs. This level yields the highest profit but requires more frequent inputs from the player as you will only perform 9 crafts per inventory taking 18 ticks or ~10.8 seconds. As with the previous level, the herblore requirement is not boostable.",
"112 Herblore",
"making-primal-extracts.90-herblore",
