"making-unfinished-spirit-weed-potions.standard",
"Spirit weed potion (unfinished) are used to create summoning potions. While the unfinished potions are very useful, they are also tedious to make and do not give meaningful Herblore experience, causing many players to purchase them instead.",
"There is usually a portable well placed and maintained by someone else next to the bank chest in the Lumbridge Market in world 84. However, if there isn't one and no-one else provides one within a reasonable amount of time, you may have to use your own wells. With a Portable Well, you can expect to produce approximately 2,310 Spirit weed potion (unfinished) per hour.",
