"Horror from the Deep quest is required to access the Lighthouse and Jossik",
"As a First Resort quest is required to access Oo'glog shops",
"Priest in Peril quest is required to access Canifis",
"Fishing Contest quest is required to access the shortcut to White Wolf Mountain",
