"mining-common-gem-rocks-in-al-kharid-mine.standard",
"Assumes the guide's 1,400 actions per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"Using the Dungeoneering cape, Dungeoneering master cape, or the Hoardstalker ring, teleport to Al Kharid resource dungeon, but do not enter the dungeon. Mine any one of several common gem rocks available. With a full inventory, teleport close to a bank, such as Edgeville lodestone, and repeat. Common gems are in demand for the creation of exquisite urns.",
"Free-to-play can either teleport close to a bank and run back via the Al Kharid lodestone or run to and from the Het's Oasis bank.",
"Mining rate can be checked using the calculator: Calculator:Mining/Rate.",
"Use the Dungeoneering cape, Dungeoneering master cape, or the Hoardstalker ring, teleport to Al Kharid resource dungeon, but do not enter the dungeon. Mine any one of several common gem rocks available. With a full inventory, teleport close to a bank, such as Edgeville lodestone, and repeat. Common gems are in demand for the creation of exquisite urns.",
