"picking-up-eggs-at-fred-s-farm.standard",
"Pick up eggs at Fred's Farm. Once you enter the farm, close the gate behind you and kill all the chickens outside the gate using cheap ranged/magic weapons (such as a chargebow or air staff). Chickens will then only respawn and spawn eggs inside the gate. Stay at the centre of the farm, and area loot as eggs shows up. It is recommended to keybind area loot to make picking up eggs easier.",
"Fred's Farm",
"Chargebow or Staff of air",
"Money making guide/Picking up eggs at Fred's Farm",
"https://runescape.wiki/w/Money_making_guide/Picking_up_eggs_at_Fred's_Farm?oldid=36473764",
"Picking up eggs at Fred's Farm",
"pickpocketing-archaeology-professors.archaeology-campus",
"Assumes the guide's 3,210 actions per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"The archaeology professor is located inside the Exam Centre.",
"Pickpocketing success chance decays over time (1% per 7.2 seconds after initial bonus success pickpockets), so stacking more buffs will allow the player a longer period before their success chance decreases below 100%. Players should generally aim for a 100% success time of 5 minutes, which is the time that the Crystal Mask spell lasts. Refreshing the spell also refreshes the player's success chance.",
"Both Crystal Mask and Light Form: With both of these, players with the minimum Thieving level and no buffs have a 100% success rate for 4 minutes. Players should aim to reach 5 minutes (the refresh time of Crystal Mask) by adding the at least +9% success chance in other buffs or Thieving levels. Players will need both runes and prayer upkeep supplies.",
"Crystal Mask only: Players can reach 5 minutes of 100% success rate with +24% in other buffs or Thieving levels. Players using this method do not need to upkeep prayer points.",
"No Crystal Mask: Players with most or all available buffs and a high level will have a high enough success chance that they no longer need to use Crystal Mask. This allows for AFK times slightly longer than five minutes.",
