"pickpocketing-vyrewatch-tither.standard",
"Use Drakan's medallion to quickly teleport to Darkmeyer. Pickpocket the Vyrewatch tither in the building north of the thievable chests (marked on the minimap). The ring of Vitur is especially useful as it prevents aggression from vyres. Without it, players should ensure that the room is cleared of vyrelords/vyreladies and the door remains closed.",
