"https://runescape.wiki/w/Money_making_guide/Screening_ancient_gravel?oldid=36948356",
"Screening ancient gravel",
"screening-ancient-gravel.members",
"With the Master archaeologist's outfit you'll receive 7% more materials plus screening will only take 1.2 seconds per gravel instead of 1.8. Meaning you will be able to screen more gravel each hour and gain more materials than what is shown on this page.",
"50 recommended (5% increase to materials)",
