"shear-sheep-to-balls-of-wool.standard",
"Start by teleporting to Burthorpe. Walk south until you hit the sheep pen (across from the cows near Burthorpe mine. Shear the sheep until your inventory is full. Walk straight to the spinning wheel (north of the cow pen) and turn it into balls of wool. Walk north to the bank chest and deposit it. The whole process takes about 2:29. Rinse and repeat for as long as you like. Once you're ready, teleport to the Exchange and sell them.",
"Each trip takes 2.5 minutes, or 24 trips per hour, with a full backpack of 28 balls of wool per trip.",
"1 Crafting",
"Money making guide/Shear Sheep To Balls Of Wool",
"https://runescape.wiki/w/Money_making_guide/Shear_Sheep_To_Balls_Of_Wool?oldid=36971613",
"Shear Sheep To Balls Of Wool",
"shearing-sheep.standard",
"The sheep pen near Taverley is the best location to collect wool due to how close it is to the bank in Burthorpe. Simply click on a sheep that has wool until your inventory is full, then bank and repeat. Each trip can be done in 100 seconds, assuming you have the pen to yourself.",
"Money making guide/Shearing sheep",
"https://runescape.wiki/w/Money_making_guide/Shearing_sheep?oldid=36447389",
"Shearing sheep",
"smelting-adamant-bars.free-to-play",
"It's recommended that the player is at least level 47 to do this method since at that level you have a 10% chance of doubling a bar without using any resources while smelting. It should take around 52 seconds to make an inventory of adamant bars, deposit them into your metal bank and then start the process over again.",
"47 Smithing (recommended)",
"Money making guide/Smelting adamant bars",
"https://runescape.wiki/w/Money_making_guide/Smelting_adamant_bars?oldid=36866566",
