"For members, completing Family Crest and wearing the smelting gauntlets is recommended, as it will allow the player to use the Make-X inventory in batches of 60 (as opposed to 28) and have their smelted bars auto-deposited into the metal bank. The blacksmith's gloves will act as smelting gauntlets if both are owned.",
