"smelting-primal-bars.standard",
"It's highly recommended that the player has at least level 106 Smithing to use this method since at level 103, you have a 10% chance of doubling a bar while smelting, and at level 106, you smelt primal bars 50% faster. It's also highly recommended to use the Superheat Form prayer while smelting as this allows you to smelt bars 0.6 seconds faster.",
"If an Orthen furnace core is used, Superheat Form can be used for NO prayer point cost, increasing profit and ability to AFK. A grace of the elves is optional, but it halves the prayer point drain of Superheat Form, meaning you'll drink fewer super prayer renewal doses. An ancient elven ritual shard can also reduce this cost.",
"Without Superheat Form, you can smelt 10,000 bars (2,000 of each input ore) in an hour at level 106 Smithing.",
"100 Smithing",
"102 strongly recommended for the Orthen furnace core",
