"smelting-silver-bars.standard",
"It takes about 72 seconds to smelt one inventory of silver ores into bars at the City of Um furnace and bank them, for 1,400 bars an hour. The next closest furnace to a bank is at Lumbridge, for 1,120 bars an hour.",
"Silver bars and ores can be deposited in the metal bank.",
"Completing the Necromancy! quest will increase Necromancy level to 5. You cannot start or continue the quest while Necromancy XP is disabled.",
"5 (if using City of Um furnace)",
"Money making guide/Smelting silver bars",
