"smithing-elder-rune-5-items.standard",
"It is highly recommended that the player is at least level 99 Smithing to do this method since the player can smith elder rune items 10% faster at level 99. It is also highly recommended to use the Superheat Form Seren prayer, as this allows smithing for longer before needing to reheat the item. If owned, wearing a grace of the elves halves the prayer point drain of Superheat Form. (While having high requirements, equipping an Orthen furnace core will stop Superheat Form from draining prayer at all.) Players can use ancient elven ritual shard and/or super prayer renewals to restore prayer points.",
"Players being on World 70 with active luminite injectors also helps increase the amount produced per hour.",
"Players can gain 6% more experience with the full blacksmith's outfit.",
"Players can receive the benefits of Varrock armour 4 without wearing the armour by completing the easy New Varrock achievements.",
"Players can gain Artisans' Workshop respect while doing this method.",
"Artisans' Workshop (highly recommended) or anywhere with an anvil",
"Ancient elven ritual shard (if using Superheat Form)",
"Smithing autoheater or Advanced smithing autoheater",
