"Grace of the elves recommended (if using Superheat Form)",
"Scroll of efficiency (recommended)",
"Smithing cape (recommended)",
"Hammer-tron or Enhanced hammer-tron or Augmented crystal hammer recommended (augmented with Rapid 4 and Tinker 4 or similar)",
"95 optional for extreme invention potion for invention boost",
